"#760","p":31,"im":["6556b5ffa3d38922a367df86e6c9a083d53dc47d"],"m":760},{"id":"alex_p31_761","t":"Hi Alex, a am a new one, freshly coming from \"hello everybody\" topic. This is my very first post all over the forum, then sorry for keeping this space in your journal, but i found, this one (after i went through several journals here) to be very effective because of the style simple and clear of the trading here posted and explained.\n\nThe chart: not a trade but analysys on USDCHF\n\n1) the Flag Limit wasn't engulfed North by the last powerful bullish leg. The only North engulfs are on previous Highs inside the Flag. 2) the S/R (i think the main one...it seems so evident..) was engulfed South eng 2...slightly but it was. Does anybody agree it can be taken as signal the price wants to deeply drop.? 3) origin of the move by a DP lower. By anybody comments very welcomed. Thanks a lot. Best, Alex.","a":"althoufx","d":"","n":"#761","p":31,"im":["daaf3a4d9168dbd0a2bb9a35808e50b1d432e329"],"m":761},{"id":"alex_p31_762","t":"Hi althoufx\n\nnot bad, step by step your analysis will be better and better. Look at charts - and look for key Levels, key Eng - and Gold rule of RTM - trade only edge of key level. Middle level - let trade only PRO, remember: our train - the second, the first - PRO.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#762","p":31,"im":[],"m":762},{"id":"alex_p31_763","t":"Thank you so much Alex, i am just considering North Edge area for eventual trades, not Middle as far. The think i've found (...thought to....) on the chart is: the price intends to drop down, from a level over current high, to somewhere below the S/R, as signals have been given by engulfs....there should be a mass of sell orders still waiting on upper levels... i'm wrong maybe, but....","a":"althoufx","d":"","n":"#763","p":31,"im":[],"m":763},{"id":"alex_p31_764","t":"Daily - big picture..I like to combine Daily /H1 - and seldom extra M1..your thought is correct...but look also H1/m30 for details in supply/demand levels.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#764","p":31,"im":[],"m":764},{"id":"alex_p31_765","t":"Be / or profit- the best result!","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#765","p":31,"im":["a2065921ab3580ef9fb7583fc9de539ebb8e54a6"],"m":765},{"id":"alex_p31_766","t":"Soon New Year, a bit aggressive trades Need to plan some gifts to New Year and something else.....\n\ntrades with risk, no expanation, but soon New Year. need to plan......","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#766","p":31,"im":["ac0d5867cd93b5cb808e1124e98fecb0b3200762","5edc2788c390bf85a9d37ad61191a15dfa443e31","cf68ff9eb4ac02dc28db2d0de483bbc022366384","c1c62a349ba43e9266688eb7608418056e19c598","63f58403d8c1f30fd0a194be6a5c9d728a2404df"],"m":766},{"id":"alex_p31_767","t":"Great Job Mate!\n\nAll the risk I see in your trades is the possibility of slippage by news. Otherwise I see all risk is already covered.\n\nNice","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#767","p":31,"im":[],"m":767},{"id":"alex_p31_768","t":"not bad, soon New Year!","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#768","p":31,"im":["8f49dc3cadfe528267256be8e19cf8eca42ee01f","f4e6a6035fe9e3c9b7f25875af1667b56d35ed24","8283ff317bd06da2b0b9418cbf7ac20f062787bf","8c4703e74f3f98e3ad30f8f4ea4c6353b472a092","2cba7d4002d69d4797d3ae5728e03c23dde60c74","4889adbdd7cf52e7d188b97a38151bf8f2f99241"],"m":768},{"id":"alex_p31_769","t":"and last","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#769","p":31,"im":["00e944e06b529d539262bb3de41e159159bd4e23"],"m":769},{"id":"alex_p31_770","t":"Very nice trades:) I have a question why did you enter GBPCHF? Could you please explain me?","a":"smile","d":"","n":"#770","p":31,"im":[],"m":770},{"id":"alex_p31_771","t":"Kovalenko wrote: and last\n\nMay be is not yet New Year yet, but Santa Claus was already here today for sure Mate","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#771","p":31,"im":[],"m":771},{"id":"alex_p31_772","t":"smile wrote: Very nice trades:) I have a question why did you enter GBPCHF? Could you please explain me?\n\nHi Smile,\n\nI hope you and Alex don't mind if I wanted 